flowchart TD
    A[Portfolio inquiry form submitted] --> B[Lead-to-Appointment workflow]
    B --> C[Apply new-inquiry tag]
    C --> D[Create opportunity in New Inquiry]
    D --> E{Service interest?}
    E -->|Braces Consultation| F[Priority review tag]
    E -->|Missing interest| G[Missing-information tag]
    E -->|Other recognized interest| H[General inquiry branch]
